  "_trap": "Google knowledge.workspace.google.com pages carry TWO dates: an editorial 'Last updated: 14 August 2026' in the body and a site-furniture footer 'Last updated 2026-08-26 UTC'. Only the editorial one means the policy moved. Reading the footer produced a false drift flag on row 61 on the 31 Aug run. Prefer the body date where both exist.",
  "_cloudflare": "canva.com marketing paths (/en_gb/pricing, /en_gb/nonprofits) return 403 to a real headless browser, but /policies/* serves fine, and /policies/policy-archives/ gives previous versions, which is how a Canva policy change is diffed rather than guessed.",
